    "type": "physical",
    "sku": "MSKDET",
    "description": "<div class=\"powr-chat\" id=\"fa409859_1652894558\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: medium; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>DETOX mineral soak: kelp and green tea powder with rosemary and lavender essential oils in Pacific sea salts. </strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>1lb 2oz / 510 g</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>Ingredients: Pacific Sea Salt, Laminaria Digitata (Kelp) powder, Lavandula Officinalis (Lavender) Essential Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Essential Oil, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Extract, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Leaf Juice. </strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\"><strong>Add 1-2 large handfuls to a warm bath and soak for 20 minutes.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>",
